	(text "3.3 V ALWAYS-ON RAIL  (TPS62177, 1 MHz, sleep mode under MCU control)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a1c9286b-8f28-49a6-9d55-efbfac0d26a7")
	)
	(text "NOTES\n1. PACK_P -> TPS62177 -> 3V3 (MCU + both TPS25751). Gauge BAT is NOT on this rail (TI: gauge must stay powered\n   with the FETs off).\n2. SLEEP low = sleep mode (internal 1.4 uA pull-down); CC2340 DIO21 (3V3_SLEEP) drives it, and R313 220k\n   holds it high while U301 is in reset or unprogrammed.\n3. PG is not used.\n4. U204 pin 4 (NC) goes to GND, as TI recommends.\n5. Diamonds are PWR_FLAGs (ERC only, no part): each sits where its rail is sourced through a passive part.\n6. The dev board's sleep-current section (R201 R_MEAS, 2 x INA190, HT7550-1) is not on P0: PACK_LP is PACK_P.\n   Measure sleep current on the dev board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b7362222-321c-4fad-bb1b-5c18b70422bc")
	)
